'''Bend Will''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shout]] obtained by progressing through the [[Skyrim:Dragonborn|Dragonborn]] expansion's main questline.

After learning and unlocking the first word, you are able to [[Skyrim:Cleansing the Stones|cleanse]] the [[Skyrim:All-Maker Stones|All-Maker Stones]] located throughout the island by shouting at them. This allows you to activate the stones, gaining their respective [[Skyrim:Powers|Powers]].

The second word is learned from [[Skyrim:Hermaeus Mora|Hermaeus Mora]] during [[Skyrim:The Gardener of Men|The Gardener of Men]]. It allows you to force other NPCs and creatures to become temporary allies.

The final word, taught to you by Hermaeus Mora at the end of The Gardener of Men, allows you to temporarily [[Skyrim:Dragon Riding|tame and ride dragons]], much like [[Skyrim:Miraak (person)|Miraak]].

Throughout the questline, it is insinuated that Miraak's power comes from this shout. He was taught this shout by Hermaeus Mora after he pledged himself in service to the Daedric Lord, and supposedly was the power he was seeking as Dragonborn up to that point; specifically, the power to have complete control over others.

